### 1. Citizen reports an issue (keeps the citizen token)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Asha Patil",
  "email": "asha.{{$random.alphanumeric(6)}}@example.test",
  "password": "citizen-pass-123"
}

> {% client.global.set("citizenToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

###
POST {{host}}/api/v1/issues
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Electric pole sparking near school",
  "description": "The pole outside the school gate has been sparking since morning.",
  "category": "STREETLIGHT",
  "latitude": 18.5204,
  "longitude": 73.8567,
  "address": "Shivaji Nagar, Pune"
}

> {% client.global.set("issueId", response.body.id); %}

### 2. A moment later the system has routed it: status ASSIGNED, priority and reason set
GET {{host}}/api/v1/issues/{{issueId}}

> {% client.global.set("version", response.body.version); %}

### Public timeline of every step
GET {{host}}/api/v1/issues/{{issueId}}/history

### 3. As the assigned Authority (log in first, keep the token as authorityToken): my queue
GET {{host}}/api/v1/issues/assigned
Authorization: Bearer {{authorityToken}}

### Plan the work (multipart: data part + optional documents)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/issues/{{issueId}}/plan
Authorization: Bearer {{authorityToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=CivSetuBoundary

--CivSetuBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="data"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": {{version}},
  "actionTaken": "Electrician team sent to isolate and repair the pole",
  "staffAllocated": "2 electricians",
  "resourcesUsed": "Insulation kit, ladder truck"
}
--CivSetuBoundary--

> {% client.global.set("version", response.body.version); %}

### Resolve with a proof photo (put a JPEG named proof.jpg next to this file)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/issues/{{issueId}}/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{authorityToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=CivSetuBoundary

--CivSetuBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="data"
Content-Type: application/json

{ "version": {{version}}, "remarks": "Wiring replaced and pole made safe." }
--CivSetuBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="proofs"; filename="proof.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./proof.jpg
--CivSetuBoundary--

> {% client.global.set("version", response.body.version); %}

### Not our department? Return it; the system re-routes it elsewhere
POST {{host}}/api/v1/issues/{{issueId}}/return
Authorization: Bearer {{authorityToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "version": {{version}}, "reason": "This is a private transformer, not a municipal streetlight." }

### 4. The reporter reopens if not satisfied
POST {{host}}/api/v1/issues/{{issueId}}/reopen
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "version": {{version}}, "reason": "The pole started sparking again this evening." }

### Admin: audit log of this issue (read-only)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/audit?entityType=ISSUE&entityId={{issueId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
